{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 Unravel the village\u2019s dark secrets, survive terrifying horrors, and escape the curse before it's too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a249eecc30306b5ea7a152d6dc2f293f.avif?t=1745993403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras_big/a249eecc30306b5ea7a152d6dc2f293f.avif?t=1745993403 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/dc7f6df160cbcd6689768cda19f911f1.avif?t=1745993403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras_big/dc7f6df160cbcd6689768cda19f911f1.avif?t=1745993403 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a3e2a5895b174ee298ce3fc60d9b42fb.avif?t=1745993403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras_big/a3e2a5895b174ee298ce3fc60d9b42fb.avif?t=1745993403 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 A gripping horror adventure where every shadow hides a secret, and every step brings you closer to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</i></strong> is a first-person horror adventure where players step into the shoes of an investigator sent to inspect strange occurrences in a remote jungle. What starts as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a terrifying nightmare, as the player is ambushed, wakes up in an unknown location, and finds themselves entangled in the dark secrets of an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With eerie messages hinting at a malevolent force and a monster lurking in the shadows, the player must navigate a haunting world filled with supernatural threats, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the village\u2019s curse before it\u2019s too late.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528270?t=1745993403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528270?t=1745993403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/92c4106b7f7775697fbcd23c0bafb10345e603a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745993403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/92c4106b7f7775697fbcd23c0bafb10345e603a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745993403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game follows a horror theme and contains blood and gore. It is intended for mature audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 Unravel the village\u2019s dark secrets, survive terrifying horrors, and escape the curse before it's too late.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a249eecc30306b5ea7a152d6dc2f293f.avif?t=1745993403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras_big/a249eecc30306b5ea7a152d6dc2f293f.avif?t=1745993403 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/dc7f6df160cbcd6689768cda19f911f1.avif?t=1745993403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras_big/dc7f6df160cbcd6689768cda19f911f1.avif?t=1745993403 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras/a3e2a5895b174ee298ce3fc60d9b42fb.avif?t=1745993403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/extras_big/a3e2a5895b174ee298ce3fc60d9b42fb.avif?t=1745993403 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</strong> \u2013 A gripping horror adventure where every shadow hides a secret, and every step brings you closer to the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Forgotten: The Curse of Village</i></strong> is a first-person horror adventure where players step into the shoes of an investigator sent to inspect strange occurrences in a remote jungle. What starts as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a terrifying nightmare, as the player is ambushed, wakes up in an unknown location, and finds themselves entangled in the dark secrets of an abandoned village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With eerie messages hinting at a malevolent force and a monster lurking in the shadows, the player must navigate a haunting world filled with supernatural threats, solve cryptic puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the village\u2019s curse before it\u2019s too late.</p>","developers":["Paras Mehra","Rion Baral"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528270/header.jpg?t=1745993403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3528270/828596/013c46bd31ad74d7a1ded842f0b506b43590d8ec/17508